{"id":"n71121-1-11","stage":1,"title":"의자 · 椅子","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71121-1-11-1","ko":"아기한테는 식탁이 너무 높은 것 같네요.","zh":"对宝宝来说，餐桌似乎太高了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기한테는","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식탁이","meaning":"餐桌","explanation":"식탁：餐桌；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"식탁","audio":"/audio/54440e480486cc26718c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26869","senseId":"1","lemma":"식탁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"높은","meaning":"高","explanation":"높다：高；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"높다","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64523","senseId":"1","lemma":"높다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같네요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"54440e480486cc26","term":"식탁","zh":"餐桌","audio":"/audio/54440e480486cc26718c.mp3","entryId":"26869","definition":"用于摆放食物、围坐起来用餐的桌子。","pronunciation":["식탁"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"5601621a4a648d5b","term":"높다","zh":"高","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3","entryId":"64523","definition":"上下距离较长。","pronunciation":["놉따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/05f6dc836e754291dc8d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71121-1-11-2","ko":"아동용 의자를 가져다 드릴까요?","zh":"需要我拿把儿童椅过来吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아동용","meaning":"儿童用","explanation":"아동용：儿童用","readings":[{"term":"아동용","audio":"/audio/6d05a0cf067da977434b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23074","senseId":"1","lemma":"아동용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의자를","meaning":"椅子","explanation":"의자：椅子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"의자","audio":"/audio/e8bb0f33e8ba6ddcf691.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71121","senseId":"1","lemma":"의자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가져다","meaning":"拿、带；가져다 드리다 指拿过来给对方","explanation":"가지다：拿、带；가져다 드리다 指拿过来给对方；어다：表示先完成前一动作，再利用其结果进行后续动作。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"1","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드릴까요?","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d05a0cf067da977","term":"아동용","zh":"儿童用","audio":"/audio/6d05a0cf067da977434b.mp3","entryId":"23074","definition":"供小孩使用；或指那样的东西。","pronunciation":["아동뇽"]},{"id":"e8bb0f33e8ba6ddc","term":"의자","zh":"椅子","audio":"/audio/e8bb0f33e8ba6ddcf691.mp3","entryId":"71121","definition":"供人以臀部和大腿接触倚坐的器具。","pronunciation":["의자"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"拿、带；가져다 드리다 指拿过来给对方","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"拿、带；가져다 드리다 指拿过来给对方","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e1c6d9e7716955adcb20.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71121","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.6634,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["需要我拿把儿童椅过来吗？","那位在哪家公司工作啊？","对宝宝来说，餐桌似乎太高了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["需要我拿把儿童椅过来吗？","对宝宝来说，餐桌似乎太高了。","那位在哪家公司工作啊？"],"answer":0}]}
